 "summary": "The projection and reflection are stated once over an arbitrary field under the minimal `g u u \u2260 0`, with the degenerate case handled unconditionally, and every Frame-level lemma is derived from them rather than reproved. Hypotheses are load-bearing and several (`|E(p)|` for the massless norm, `c \u2260 0` from `F'.timelike`, `isOrthogonal_reflection` for all `u`) are weaker than the obvious ones; the abstract `(V, g)` level is the one the roadmap names.",
